WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
Can the slope of a line be negative?

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.430
Positive m: the line climbs as you go right.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.160
Negative m: the line falls as you go right.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.610
And m of zero? Flat. No climb at all.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:21.013
So the sign of m tells you: uphill, downhill, or perfectly level.
